<title>UK: Lndon precious metals end firmer except for gold.</title>
<headline>Lndon precious metals end firmer except for gold.</headline>
<text>
<p>GOLD - Closed at $323.40/$323.90 vs $324.00/$324.50 Friday. Very quiet, pressure from firm dollar most of day. $324.00 support under test but little momentum.</p>
<p>SILVER - Ended at $4.49/$4.51 up five cents. At resistance.</p>
<p>PLATINUM - Ended up $13.00 at $450.00/$453.00.</p>
<p>PALLADIUM - Firmed on short covering and sharp move in New York. Stil tight. $235.60/$238.60, up $12.60.</p>
</text>
